<?php

declare(strict_types=1);

/**
 * -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * NexusCore
 * -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * File        : ReportService.php
 * Location    : app/Services/
 * Description : Reporting Engine — foundation service for all competition
 *               reports generated by NexusCore EMS.
 *
 * Responsibilities
 * -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * • Authorization: who may generate reports
 * • Report ID generation (RPT-REG-YYYY-NNNNN)
 * • Retrieve and structure competition participant data
 * • Compute summary statistics (total, status, gender, type, dept, year)
 * • Compute department sub-totals
 * • Support dual mode: Registration Sheet + Attendance Sheet
 * • Retrieve attendance data when Attendance Sheet mode is selected
 * • Provide filter options (departments, years, statuses)
 *
 * Future Report Types (reuse this service)
 * -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * • Registration Report   ← implemented here
 * • Attendance Sheet      ← implemented here (dual mode)
 * • Evaluation Sheet
 * • Results Sheet
 * • Winner List
 * • Certificate Register
 *
 * NOTE
 * -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 * This class NEVER contains raw SQL.
 * SQL belongs only in Model classes.
 *
 * -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 */

